{"data":{"body":"[P2] Size overflow payloads without materializing the envelope\n\n`OVERFLOW` builds the complete inline JSON envelope merely to discover that it exceeds the limit. Large payloads therefore allocate multiple full-size strings and byte buffers before offloading and can exhaust heap. Measure using a capped/counting JSON sink, or compute the exact encoded size, and only materialize the inline envelope when it fits.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogZcD","finding_digest":"6eabed5c19c2711aa446780bc46760c29a3278f03c48a2ff2146e395f79af195","finding_id":"arf_v1_n2v62xazyjyrvjcgpaf4iz3ayk","finding_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::serialize::bounded-overflow-envelope-sizing","identity_key":"filesystem-serdes-stage::serialize::bounded-overflow-envelope-sizing","line":115,"observation_digest":"c318a41225c3d3a208bf1ddbc682689ce52dafe4a06bfd3421c49dc8c2af368e","observation_id":"aro_v1_ymmkierfypj2ecf7dxn4natitt","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/FileSystemSerDesStage.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:36:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_lg7klicms47wv6riosxce65qkn","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"f1e9928dd8b85e6321366254d10182fc54aafb83","reviewer":"codex","start_line":115,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_rvomfghdyuxpmvxe5raaupz5ik","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:36:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
